                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I enjoyed the game, I started off thinking it was a stealth game, but it's not. \n\nVoice syncing is off, game itself was pretty easy you really can just go in and start shooting which ever area you're in.\n\nLoved some of the mechanics of the game, especially the strategy option of the game where you can direct your characters to go to certain spots/areas and defend or attack, felt like live action chess\n\nI followed a guide for some of the achievements, especially at the start of Chapter 4, worth a playthrough\n\nI havn'et played the others Fear Effect games, so i don't have anything to compare it too",
